  "task_html": "<div style='margin:10px 0 14px;'><iframe width='100%' style='aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:10px;border:none;display:block;' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/gII-008rdWo' title='Gleichsetzungsverfahren erklärt' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture' allowfullscreen></iframe></div><div style='background:#fffbeb;border:1.5px solid #fde68a;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:10px 0;'><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'><strong>Idee:</strong> Wenn <em>beide</em> Gleichungen schon nach derselben Variablen aufgelöst sind (z.&nbsp;B. beide nach y), kannst du die rechten Seiten direkt <em>gleichsetzen</em> – so bleibt nur noch eine Unbekannte übrig, die du normal ausrechnen kannst.</p></div><div style='background:#f8f8f8;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;margin:12px 0;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 12px;color:#374151;'>Beispiel: &nbsp; (I) y = 3x&minus;2 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II) y = &minus;2x+8</p><div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:8px 0;'><span style='background:#d97706;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:22px;height:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;'>1</span><span style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;'>Beide Gleichungen sind bereits nach y aufgelöst: &nbsp;<strong>y = 3x&minus;2</strong> und <strong>y = &minus;2x+8</strong></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:8px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:22px;height:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;'>2</span><span style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;'>Rechte Seiten gleichsetzen: &nbsp; <span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;'>3x&minus;2</span> = <span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;'>&minus;2x+8</span></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:8px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:22px;height:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;'>3</span><span style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;'>Vereinfachen &amp; lösen: &nbsp; 5x&minus;2=8 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; 5x=10 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; <strong>x = 2</strong></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin:8px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:22px;height:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;'>4</span><span style='font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;'>x = 2 in (I) einsetzen: &nbsp; y = 3&middot;2&minus;2 = <strong>4</strong></span></div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 12px;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;'>&#x2713; Lösung: <strong>(2&nbsp;|&nbsp;4)</strong> &nbsp; Probe in (II): &minus;2&middot;2+8 = 4 &#x2713;</div></div><hr style='margin:16px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #ddd;'><p style='font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:8px 0;'>Jetzt du! Löse mit dem Gleichsetzungsverfahren:</p><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:10px 0 4px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;color:#1e3a8a;'>Aufgabe 1</p><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>(I) y = 4x&minus;1 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II) y = x+5</p></div><div style='font-size:13px;line-height:2.4;padding:2px 0 8px;'>&#x2460; Beide Seiten gleichsetzen: &nbsp; <span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'>4x&minus;1</span> = <span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'>x+5</span> &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; vereinfacht: 3x&minus;1 = 5<br>&#x2461; x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:70px;display:inline-block;' data-ans='2' placeholder='?'><br>&#x2462; y = x+5 = <input class='cell-input' style='width:70px;display:inline-block;' data-ans='7' placeholder='?'></div><div style='background:#fef9c3;border-left:3px solid #fde68a;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#78350f;margin:10px 0;'>📝 Ab jetzt: Rechne die Zwischenschritte (Gleichsetzen, Auflösen) auf einem Blatt Papier &ndash; hier trägst du nur noch x und y ein.</div><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:10px 0 4px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;color:#1e3a8a;'>Aufgabe 2</p><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>(I) y = 2x+2 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II) y = x+6</p></div><div style='font-size:13px;padding:2px 0 8px;'>x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:70px;display:inline-block;' data-ans='4' placeholder='?'> &nbsp;&nbsp; y = <input class='cell-input' style='width:70px;display:inline-block;' data-ans='10' placeholder='?'></div><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:10px 0 4px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;color:#1e3a8a;'>Aufgabe 3</p><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>(I) y = 5x&minus;3 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II) y = 2x+6</p></div><div style='font-size:13px;padding:2px 0 8px;'>x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:70px;display:inline-block;' data-ans='3' placeholder='?'> &nbsp;&nbsp; y = <input class='cell-input' style='width:70px;display:inline-block;' data-ans='12' placeholder='?'></div><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:10px 0 4px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;color:#1e3a8a;'>Aufgabe 4</p><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>(I) y = x+1 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II) y = 3x&minus;5</p></div><div style='font-size:13px;padding:2px 0 8px;'>x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:70px;display:inline-block;' data-ans='3' placeholder='?'> &nbsp;&nbsp; y = <input class='cell-input' style='width:70px;display:inline-block;' data-ans='4' placeholder='?'></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(8)'>&#x2713; Überprüfen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(8)'>&#x21BA; Zurücksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-8'></span></div>",
  "sol_html": "<p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;'><strong>Aufgabe 1:</strong> 4x&minus;1=x+5 &rarr; 3x=6 &rarr; x=<strong>2</strong>, y=2+5=<strong>7</strong> &nbsp; Probe: 4&middot;2&minus;1=7 &check; &nbsp; Lösung: <strong>(2|7)</strong><br><strong>Aufgabe 2:</strong> 2x+2=x+6 &rarr; x=<strong>4</strong>, y=4+6=<strong>10</strong> &nbsp; Probe: 2&middot;4+2=10 &check; &nbsp; Lösung: <strong>(4|10)</strong><br><strong>Aufgabe 3:</strong> 5x&minus;3=2x+6 &rarr; 3x=9 &rarr; x=<strong>3</strong>, y=2&middot;3+6=<strong>12</strong> &nbsp; Probe: 5&middot;3&minus;3=12 &check; &nbsp; Lösung: <strong>(3|12)</strong><br><strong>Aufgabe 4:</strong> x+1=3x&minus;5 &rarr; 2x=6 &rarr; x=<strong>3</strong>, y=3+1=<strong>4</strong> &nbsp; Probe: 3&middot;3&minus;5=4 &check; &nbsp; Lösung: <strong>(3|4)</strong></p>",
  "mandatory": true
